  <p class="gd-byline" style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--blue-soft);opacity:.9;margin:16px 0 0">By <a href="/about" style="color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px">Heliski Travel Team</a> · Updated 27 Aug 2026</p>
  <p class="gd-lede">There is a particular magic to skiing at the top of the world: lines that fall from mountain summits straight to the ocean, daylight that stretches into the small hours, and mountains almost entirely to yourself. Arctic heli-skiing, in Iceland, Norway, Greenland and beyond, is a category of its own. This guide explains what makes it special, when to go, and how the far-north destinations compare, before you look at <a href="/packages">the packages</a>.</p>
